1ipa|n|A mass of type confusedly mixed or unsorted.	V:1rdb,33,2~1rdb,33,2	n:1o4q,81,28~1o4q,81,28	N:zoa,100,3;1em2,83,7;29t6,43,3;b06,40,5;1rdb,33,2~1em2,83,7;b06,40,5;zoa,100,3;29t6,43,3;1rdb,33,2
